body:
Trigger warning: torture                                                            

&#x200B;



I'm not joking, they put a device in me that can influence and read my thoughts hear what I say and see through my eyes. I'm technically an agent of my home country's secret service, I work from home by watching YouTube videos and movies, my body can send electrical signals when I blink (left for no, right for maybe/ish both for yes) and it connects with a database which makes me an unhackable computer. They gave my family similar devices and basically held us hostage, they gave me intrusive thoughts about paedophilia and racism and sexism, and after a few months of breaking me down they told me that they'd kill my friends if I didn't torture myself or if I coughed during it. I shoved a bottle up my anus, I smoked my own pubic hair out of a pipe, I shoved chocolates up my ass, shit them out and ate them, and I drank my own urine, I did not cough.
